{"action_ordinal":5,"episode_id":"r1ep-c860be0b1d8ed7adcb6913ae3a6dd2c1","kind":"filesystem_observation","observation_id":"obs-0003","observation_sha256":"be02fff51b7876e30303a064d867f2bfbc49308b7ea4a858e1c2ca276a4453b3","ordinal":3,"provider_round":4,"question_sha256":"abb6be815105b6f2057cf733e280624a23463fb99c145008e90ab82d86a14278","read_receipt":{"action_ordinal":5,"episode_id":"r1ep-c860be0b1d8ed7adcb6913ae3a6dd2c1","key_id":"30dfe51973d24b288bf71d912f3ecb64aaae9943e58238defd60ab323b47dada","ordinal":3,"provider_round":4,"question_sha256":"abb6be815105b6f2057cf733e280624a23463fb99c145008e90ab82d86a14278","receipt_mac":"93c4c1abaee56ead89616eac2cea6c4f90f844d6c027179184860f184a9418eb","result_sha256":"d12e4af359fedf7c1401409d5e83c2ebfceaec7bc6c87f09f26ab895e95fc4e9","schema_version":2,"snapshot_ref_sha256":"fb38c6c1d50aeae07cd391df0e916f04520cf904ce68add77202a37c1102d1f9"},"result":{"canonical_args":{"end_line":60,"path":"/memories/session-28.md","start_line":30},"content":"L30: Dave: Wow, Calvin! Creating something that brings people together and inspires them - that's really awesome!\nL31: [S28T6] (dia_id: D28:6)\nL32: \nL33: Calvin: Thanks, Dave! It's an awesome feeling. Creating something that people connect with and brings joy is what I'm all about. Moments like this really motivate me to keep growing!\nL34: [S28T7] (dia_id: D28:7)\nL35: \nL36: Dave: Wow, Calvin, imagining how your music affects others must be incredible! Keep up the great work! By the way, I recently started a blog on car mods. It's my way to share my passion with others. Do you have any tips on blogging for me? Just take a look at this beautiful car!\nL37: \nL38: \nL39: [Image caption: a photography of a car website design]\nL40: [S28T8] (dia_id: D28:8)\nL41: \nL42: Calvin: Cool, Dave! It's really fun to share your passion through blogging. Have you had any success stories yet with inspiring others?\nL43: [S28T9] (dia_id: D28:9)\nL44: \nL45: Dave: Thanks, Calvin! It's awesome people are checking out my blog and asking me for advice. I recently posted about how I made this car look like a beast, and it was great to hear it inspired others to start their own DIY projects.\nL46: [Image caption: a photography of a blue subarunt parked in a parking lot]\nL47: [S28T10] (dia_id: D28:10)\nL48: \nL49: Calvin: Wow, Dave! Your blog is awesome. Helping others get creative is awesome. Keep up the great work!\nL50: [S28T11] (dia_id: D28:11)\nL51: \nL52: Dave: Thanks, Calvin! I appreciate the support. It's fulfilling to share my knowledge and help others unleash their creativity.\nL53: [S28T12] (dia_id: D28:12)\nL54: \nL55: Calvin: Yeah Dave, keep doing what you do! Your blog and car mods are inspiring and a great way to help people find their creativity.\nL56: [S28T13] (dia_id: D28:13)\nL57: \nL58: Dave: Thanks, Calvin! It means a lot that you enjoy my blog. This car mod was a lot of work, but I think it was worth it in the end.\nL59: [Image caption: a photography of a blue subarunt parked in a parking lot]\nL60: [S28T14] (dia_id: D28:14)","content_sha256":"85f0d96ede0b982111c5012c2beca1e9c6e03cc055e10b80a8ba334bfc5697ab","coverage":[{"line_end":60,"line_start":30,"path":"/memories/session-28.md"}],"post_tree_sha256":"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582939aa63688c1923c7679","pre_tree_sha256":"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582939aa63688c1923c7679","protocol_version":"center-table12-readonly-v1","result_count":31,"result_sha256":"d12e4af359fedf7c1401409d5e83c2ebfceaec7bc6c87f09f26ab895e95fc4e9","root_survey":false,"tool_name":"view","truncated":false,"whole_tree_grep":false},"schema_version":2,"store_id":"s1","store_snapshot_sha256":"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582939aa63688c1923c7679"}
